flowchart LR
    S[Input samples] --> C[Correlator]
    C --> E[Early]
    C --> P[Prompt]
    C --> L[Late]
    E --> D[DLL discriminator]
    L --> D
    D --> F[Loop filter]
    F --> N[NCO]
    N --> C
    P --> Q[Lock metric]
    Q --> STATE{Lock valid?}
    STATE -->|yes| F
    STATE -->|no| LOST[Lost / reacquire]
